            <lg xml:id="m-cffcc6bb-9eaa-4c35-8280-d2480030c42a">
              <l xml:id="m-f8db6f38-b685-4eda-8c84-de19118b9813" facs="#m-eb2c81fa-d328-4286-a064-b1947df5b386" label="ambiguous">1416</l><l xml:id="m-95bdf139-1202-46c0-8f0e-aae440eab815" facs="#m-dfe20729-85e1-445f-afdf-7838e55c17e6" label="ambiguous">March 25.</l><l xml:id="m-1ca66c33-5149-4d1d-bdc6-bdea60c63fdd" facs="#m-34a224a5-aa09-4e17-bfbb-b6f4faf70537" label="text-like">In Paschal Time, the Gradual and Tract are omitted. Alleltia, alleltia.</l><l xml:id="m-c03ea1ee-08b6-4d49-9a37-54d304b3ed47" facs="#m-ebce3227-165f-40bf-acd6-059644a2b02b" label="lyrics-like">V. Ave María. p. 1265, and Alleluia. Y. Virga Jésse. p. 1267, are said instead.</l><l xml:id="m-a8f91a10-93f2-4751-9bde-edd066d400dc" facs="#m-7a1d6947-e1ec-4cbd-9761-aeaebf6310e7" label="ambiguous">Gospel. Missus est. p. 1270. Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-f2cafc5e-cb2f-44fe-8dbb-2e308ad6528b" facs="#m-a6d170b9-4888-4f30-b8c6-13f07e523757" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Ave María. p. 1268.</l><l xml:id="m-408eb07c-f03c-4da9-a051-30ac774940c4" facs="#m-9502001f-d126-482d-b2fb-3c4d6710c148" label="lyrics-like">Secret. In méntibus nostris. p. 127.</l><l xml:id="m-2c938349-91da-4551-832b-2726afeaa8ae" facs="#m-4f7bac4e-9059-4db0-a4d9-1df4f2edb4c1" label="lyrics-like">Preface of the Blessed Virgin Mary. Et te in Annuntiatióne. p. 10.</l><l xml:id="m-71b1d60a-5b8e-4850-b0d5-b303ab5c98fe" facs="#m-62666cdf-57c1-4e51-ae30-0fd65a2e88d1" label="lyrics-like">Communion. Ecce vírgo. D. 356. (P. T. Allelúia. First tone, p. 96.)</l><l xml:id="m-eddc6c66-03a7-46b3-ad4c-69c47170fecb" facs="#m-d6e253b6-0e81-4bb0-ad24-4996a6ba4793" label="lyrics-like">Postcommunton. Grátiam tuam. p. 1271.</l><l xml:id="m-8e2fd8aa-76a7-4fcb-898d-8c3fe6b21e8d" facs="#m-89c37277-6c70-4f83-9a5b-49f868d51d7e" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-87a43a06-5282-4d93-8b6c-ac09226a7313" facs="#m-18d40670-f88a-4d6f-9d87-191354846226" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Ne tímeas. p. 1417.</l><l xml:id="m-047a2d27-67e6-4806-8822-9b9579139142" facs="#m-cb2bbb21-a5e0-46cb-96d2-af5ed5a2bab5" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-d6902906-9266-4d88-92cb-f20c389d90ef" facs="#m-c65e5ef7-bf0b-400f-84fa-8d5a29e73d35" label="ambiguous">Luc. 1. a.</l><l xml:id="m-11888766-d89f-4763-930d-3e79e1075b7d" facs="#m-e083b743-bfc7-40ae-8221-940b2acb4956" label="lyrics-like">Abit illi Dóminus Deus sedem bit in domo Jacob in aetérnum,</l><l xml:id="m-8138e8a8-a813-47fb-8d89-fb85897a0cf1" facs="#m-1556bb49-c2e1-4d8f-8d6c-bc16fd9abd61" label="lyrics-like">U David patris ejus:  et regná-l et regni ejus non erit finis.</l><l xml:id="m-e324557b-297f-4c7b-9d3a-a453246478ad" facs="#m-97e3288e-b026-4535-9617-c360972c88e8" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Adjuvábit éam. p. 127 v. Elégit éam.</l><l xml:id="m-0bb13986-35ad-44ea-99db-2b7ef35f8707" facs="#m-5233c697-c9e7-48b7-b7ef-b0d80c9936b6" label="text-like">AT NONE</l><l xml:id="m-23c56824-5b79-4556-abbc-84701a83fa9d" facs="#m-3027c8b6-0687-4050-ab02-d1b198913f10" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Ecce ancilla Dómini. p. 1417.</l><l xml:id="m-6c5f512f-2f57-44ee-98d7-c7e08a1914c0" facs="#m-48db99c3-791f-4c30-a826-a684a02ce862" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-e6b63f11-f52b-4924-b744-e079ee567010" facs="#m-50045fb7-00f8-465a-90cf-4f8b646690e2" label="ambiguous">Is.11.</l><l xml:id="m-2f0212c7-d041-4509-89b1-3999da0b8238" facs="#m-a0edc4e7-7bce-481d-8927-704e654096b3" label="lyrics-like">(Grediétur virga de radice Jes- det.“Et requiéscet super eum</l><l xml:id="m-9fe2ece6-994b-44cd-8703-957ca5f73520" facs="#m-bd40165a-8126-4672-ad43-87c07792ef92" label="lyrics-like">L se, t et flos de radice ejus ascén¬ Spiritus Dómini.</l><l xml:id="m-3c4becae-ead3-4103-8428-fddcf93bd4a3" facs="#m-922af690-96d5-4fe4-828b-3d1e7c0f3249" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Elégit éam. p. 1258. V. Diffúsa est.</l><l xml:id="m-73ce51c2-7093-4f09-a8ef-efe1fe4bee05" facs="#m-e2a9d4d3-82c1-4beb-8418-eb20d2aa46d8" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-767cab7a-2c81-4fe1-93ed-4aa61bb476c9" facs="#m-847be019-78c3-4f82-9ca6-322ecd85e8f2" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. 1. Dixit Dóminus. 8. G p. 133. — 2. Laudáte púeri. 1. g.</l><l xml:id="m-523627eb-0c6d-4320-83e4-6d86c2b501c6" facs="#m-c918b74b-ae16-4d62-89b6-9aff6379a847" label="lyrics-like">o. 148. — 3. Laetátus sum. 8. G. p. 173.— 4. Nisi Dóminus. I. f. p. 178.</l><l xml:id="m-cee47669-98fe-416f-8cad-697f82826e6c" facs="#m-e22643fe-3086-4fdf-b72a-a05aca399a74" label="lyrics-like">— 5. Láuda Jerúsalem. 8. c. p. 206.</l><l xml:id="m-7e081db5-ae76-4521-befc-db49ded92c0b" facs="#m-a9e104b9-a991-4ac1-841a-d0bc62ab4b2b" label="ambiguous">1. Ant.8</l><l xml:id="m-c3930d0a-7225-4487-86f0-83ce42f95cf5" facs="#m-7ae2dc88-1fda-43a5-baa1-bccf28f47f1b" label="ambiguous">S.6</l><l xml:id="m-5097d7ca-c99d-45e8-894e-b27afb965de2" facs="#m-545797b6-464c-41e0-abdd-db872947a486" label="lyrics-like">Issus est “Gábri-el Ange-lus ad Ma-rí-am Vírgi¬</l><l xml:id="m-24dddc75-d544-410a-9e94-30501e5055f2" facs="#m-b348f1c6-eff6-4c6a-96c7-ee630e567717" label="lyrics-like">nem desponsá-tam Jóseph. P. T. Alle-lú-ia. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-48f91d55-602a-4ba2-bb71-a0f4593332f3" facs="#m-be4dc2ce-beb4-47fa-b419-12b5e659d627" label="ambiguous">2.Ant—</l><l xml:id="m-db726894-0421-4218-b3a8-826678696d80" facs="#m-d85966d6-b49b-4c89-90ce-dd9a1ba6597c" label="ambiguous">1.8 —</l><l xml:id="m-f973c09f-c298-4a1d-8644-5a3941817b7b" facs="#m-d3b31e91-4fe2-40a0-b55a-4792c980ad16" label="lyrics-like">-ve Ma-rí-a, * grá-ti-a pléna: Dóminus técum:</l><l xml:id="m-eda78d7e-8240-47df-ace8-28d01ac9c505" facs="#m-2653fce1-1cdd-452f-b8cc-efaf3d9d57b9" label="lyrics-like">benedícta tu t in mu-li-éribus. P. T. in mu-li-é-ribus, al¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
